		{
			dependencies: ["1FCDA02A8AF6F019"]
			description: ["Hold the &eWave Horn&r and right-click to call the next wave. Nothing comes until you do, with one catch: after each clear a timer starts, and when it runs out the wave comes on its own. About a minute and a half after wave 1, a little longer each wave, four minutes and up from wave 5. Use the gap to repair, restock and build. Then blow it."]
			icon: "kubejs:wave_horn"
			id: "2965C45D5F6A0991"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "035C228778FC17F0"
