		{
			dependencies: ["2965C45D5F6A0991"]
			description: ["Five plain zombies by your own hand; turret and trap kills don't count here (they do for the Bounties tab). Wave 1 is nine mobs: five zombies, three husks, one zombie villager. Enough to find out whether your gear holds."]
