		{
			dependencies: ["7F675AEBC7301832"]
			description: ["Every mob down means the wave is cleared, the timer to the next one starts, and the border grows: 5 blocks a wave for waves 1 to 3, then 10, then 15, another 5 every three waves. More ground to hold and more ground to loot."]
