		{
			dependencies: ["538A1BBC9A1B8EAC"]
			description: ["Three down, and the horde's just getting started. Wave 4 brings the first &cBoomer&r and two Split Head Zombies; wave 5 the first Elites. Check Know Your Enemy before you sound the next horn, and spend what you've got - everything below this point on the tree is buildable now."]
