		{
			dependencies: ["03C4E700B07CBC15"]
			description: [
				"Wave 8 is the last one anyone planned: a Crawler on the walls, a Mutant Brute at the gate, a Demolition Zombie throwing TNT. After this the waves don't stop and don't repeat - every one past 8 is an endless level, and each one hits harder than the last. How much harder, and how the mix shifts as it climbs, isn't written down anywhere. You'll feel it before anyone could tell you."
				"Every fifth wave a supply crate drops near the base with a map marker on it: a Legendary bag, netherite scrap, a diamond block."
			]
