		{
			dependencies: ["42EDC7E6DB5ABFAA"]
			description: ["Every tenth wave brings a boss on top of the wave. &cThe Behemoth&r is a Mutant Brute with 600 health, 30 damage a hit and full netherite, and you'll hear it coming. It drops a &eTotem of Undying&r when it dies, and that's the one reliable source of one. The same wave drops a supply crate."]
