		{
			dependencies: ["0882BEAE557D28DD"]
			description: ["Eight gold ingots in a ring make the &eAmulet&r. Gold comes as ingots from Rare bags or nuggets from Uncommon ones, nine to an ingot. It goes in the Curios necklace slot in your inventory, not an armour slot."]
